    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……行き過ぎた情熱は
空回りして自分や周りを
苦しめるんだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...If you get too passionate, you can end up
achieving nothing, and only causing problems
for both yourself and those around you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269524</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今は寝かしておくべさ！
ちっとは空気読め！このハゲぼうず！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You need to let her rest right now! Learn
to read the room a little, ya numbskull!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>don't think i ever saw this in context, not sure what it's referring to</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>65</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ミラルドが留守だからって、
まさか家事をやらされるとは
思わなかったよ……　トホホ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know Mirald is away, but I
never thought I'd get roped into
doing the housework... Ahaha...</EnglishText>
